gap receipt_sent
Nothing says whether a receipt was sent when the cart was open, an item was added, checkout was started, payment was submitted, payment was declined, the address was not confirmed, the customer was subscribing, the customer was cancelling, the customer was signed in, a card was saved, and stock was available. Suggested fix: add a requirement for this situation, and ask what the system shall do. Do not choose the response.

gap billed_seats
Nothing covers the billed seats when the cart was open, an item was added, checkout was started, payment was submitted, payment was declined, the address was confirmed, the customer was subscribing, the customer was cancelling, the customer was signed in, a card was saved, and stock was not available. Suggested fix: add a requirement for this situation, and ask what the system shall do. Do not choose the response.

